    tput reset 2>/dev/null || clear
    codex "Review this PR. Analyze the diff against $PR_BASE branch. Write a comprehensive code review to REVIEW.md covering: code quality, potential bugs, security issues, performance concerns, and suggestions for improvement. Be thorough and specific with file:line references."

